{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2026施政報告再加推11項新措施鼓勵生育。第二名或之後出生的嬰兒獎勵金加至30,000元，相關子女免稅額提高至160,000元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"4-3.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20266Yau3WxDNX1790321107.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4-3.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新生嬰兒家庭買樓可減最多20,000元印花稅。居屋白表家庭最高按揭提升至95%。同時增加IVF名額、幼兒中心及課後託管，支援家庭由生育到育兒。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T23:38:40.067992+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}